    "intro": {
      "zh": "PlayStation Vita 是索尼 2011 年发布的 PSP 后继掌机，采用 5 英寸 OLED 宽屏、正面触屏与背部触控板、左右双摇杆，性能延续家用机化路线，是索尼掌机线的高性能代表作。",
      "en": "The PlayStation Vita, released by Sony in 2011 as the successor to the PSP, features a 5-inch OLED widescreen, a front touch screen, a rear touchpad, and dual analog sticks, continuing the console-class performance path and standing as Sony's high-performance handheld."
    },
    "era": 2011, "manufacturer": "Sony"
